WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.625 --> 01:39.065
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:53.585 --> 01:54.745
Come in.

01:59.745 --> 02:02.385
So? The results are out?

02:03.705 --> 02:05.665
She deserves the Specialist title.

02:07.025 --> 02:10.584
And it turns out, about 80%
of my decisions are right,

02:10.665 --> 02:12.185
and 20% are wrong.

02:12.265 --> 02:14.585
But when it comes to people,
you made the right decisions.

02:15.185 --> 02:16.945
Shang Zhitao is outstanding.

02:17.025 --> 02:18.225
You have a good eye for talent.

02:49.905 --> 02:51.265
Well prepared. Who did this?

02:51.865 --> 02:53.705
Dony must've planted someone here
before he went to prison.

02:53.785 --> 02:55.265
The whistleblower was one
of his former subordinates.

02:55.345 --> 02:57.345
Someone who worked at Lime briefly.

02:57.425 --> 02:58.585
A real piece of work.

02:59.505 --> 03:00.865
He's like a bad penny.

03:06.385 --> 03:09.265
The day Flora reported him
for sexual harassment,

03:09.345 --> 03:11.705
you stepped in
and dealt with him yourself.

03:12.225 --> 03:14.185
That's when I knew something
was going on between you.

03:15.105 --> 03:17.665
I'd actually sensed it before then.

03:18.185 --> 03:21.585
I didn't say anything
because I know where your line is.

03:22.625 --> 03:26.065
And I trusted that she wasn't the kind
of employee who'd break the rules.

03:26.985 --> 03:27.825
But

03:29.265 --> 03:30.505
someone gave me this.

03:32.665 --> 03:34.185
What are you going to do with it?

03:40.265 --> 03:44.025
A GRAND RETREAT

03:49.905 --> 03:51.145
LIME ANNUAL APPRECIATION NIGHT

04:13.585 --> 04:14.945
Cheers, Lumi.

04:22.665 --> 04:24.225
Song Ying made the shortlist.
Did you know that?

04:27.145 --> 04:28.265
I just found out.

04:28.865 --> 04:33.185
Her dad is giving 80%
of next year's ad budget to Lime.

04:34.105 --> 04:37.145
Eighty percent? How much is that?

04:37.225 --> 04:39.745
Two hundred and fifty million.
Across all platforms.

04:40.465 --> 04:42.065
That's the power of money.

04:46.945 --> 04:48.065
Flora.

04:48.625 --> 04:50.185
-Congratulations.
-Kitty.

04:50.265 --> 04:51.745
You finally made Specialist this year.

04:53.265 --> 04:56.625
I'm telling you,
you're the most envied woman at Lime.

04:57.545 --> 04:58.785
Got your acceptance speech ready?

04:59.825 --> 05:01.105
I still need to work on it.

05:01.185 --> 05:02.385
Don't worry. You'll be fine.

05:02.465 --> 05:05.025
Flora, I just joined
the company this year.

05:05.105 --> 05:06.785
Please look out for me.

05:06.865 --> 05:08.465
-Do your best.
-Thank you.

05:08.545 --> 05:09.665
I'll head over first.

05:13.385 --> 05:15.425
Relax. It's definitely you.

05:15.505 --> 05:17.385
Everyone knows it.

05:17.465 --> 05:19.825
If she wins, people won't accept it.
It won't be her.

05:20.465 --> 05:22.065
If someone's going to win,

05:22.145 --> 05:24.385
why can't it be you?

05:24.465 --> 05:27.225
If it's not you,
I'll be the first to object.

05:36.825 --> 05:37.745
Luke.

05:44.585 --> 05:45.945
Thank you for your guidance and support.

05:49.385 --> 05:50.265
Keep up the good work.

05:57.945 --> 05:58.785
Let's talk later.

06:04.585 --> 06:07.145
Distinguished leaders, honored guests,

06:07.225 --> 06:10.465
ladies and gentlemen,
dear Lime family and friends,

06:10.545 --> 06:13.065
good evening!

06:15.265 --> 06:17.505
Next, it's time for our biggest award,

06:17.585 --> 06:20.105
the announcement
of this year's Specialist.

06:20.185 --> 06:23.665
Lime is the leading advertising agency
in the industry.

06:23.745 --> 06:25.745
The Specialist we choose each year

06:25.825 --> 06:31.505
must have made outstanding contributions
and achieved remarkable results.

06:31.585 --> 06:34.665
They'll help lead the advertising industry
to new heights

06:34.745 --> 06:37.065
and serve as an example to us all.

06:37.145 --> 06:41.305
This year's finalists
are the head of the Northwest project,

06:41.385 --> 06:45.345
who has served the company
faithfully for six years, Flora.

06:47.025 --> 06:48.505
-Thank you.
-Shang Zhitao.

06:48.585 --> 06:50.065
I love you.

06:50.145 --> 06:51.385
THE LEGEND IS HERE!

06:53.145 --> 06:55.265
And the second finalist,
who was selected by exception,

06:55.345 --> 06:56.185
a rising star in the industry

06:56.265 --> 07:01.625
who secured the company's
biggest account of the year, Yilia.

07:07.105 --> 07:09.545
Who will take home the title?

07:09.625 --> 07:13.865
Now, please welcome Luke,
the General Manager of Lime Advertising,

07:13.945 --> 07:18.865
to announce this year's Specialist.

07:18.945 --> 07:20.145
A big round of applause.

07:51.865 --> 07:52.945
This year's

07:54.905 --> 07:56.745
Lime Specialist is…

08:01.985 --> 08:03.465
Yilia, Song Ying.

08:49.185 --> 08:51.185
SONG YING, LIME SPECIALIST

08:51.265 --> 08:52.105
Thank you.

08:55.025 --> 08:59.385
Alright. Yilia, how do you feel
about winning this honor?

08:59.465 --> 09:01.185
Thank you to the company
for this recognition.

09:01.945 --> 09:05.025
I'd like to share this honor with Flora.

09:11.225 --> 09:12.945
I… Thank you.

09:23.905 --> 09:25.905
It belongs to you.

09:25.985 --> 09:27.145
You've done an incredible job.

09:27.825 --> 09:30.665
When I was your age,
I wasn't anywhere near as good.

09:31.625 --> 09:33.425
I was completely ordinary.

09:34.305 --> 09:37.185
It was an honor to compete with you.

09:37.265 --> 09:38.385
Congratulations.

09:38.465 --> 09:40.785
Alright. Thank you both
for your wonderful speeches.

09:40.865 --> 09:43.545
Now, let the banquet begin.

10:44.105 --> 10:45.425
Please excuse me.

11:27.625 --> 11:28.665
Are you okay?

11:31.665 --> 11:34.625
Sun Yu and I are catching
a midnight movie later.

11:38.065 --> 11:39.185
Is Sun Yuanzhu not coming?

11:48.945 --> 11:51.145
You knew today's result, didn't you?

11:55.905 --> 11:57.705
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

11:59.265 --> 12:00.785
Would that have changed the outcome?

12:02.985 --> 12:03.945
Of course not.

12:07.425 --> 12:10.665
But Lumi knew Song Ying
was competing against me.

12:10.745 --> 12:12.625
She told me in advance.

12:12.705 --> 12:14.905
You've been my superior for years.

12:14.985 --> 12:17.745
You knew how much
I'd put into this project.

12:18.265 --> 12:19.185
And you just sat there,

12:19.265 --> 12:22.385
watching me wait in anticipation
below the stage like a clown.

12:23.865 --> 12:27.185
If it wasn't Song Ying,
it would've been someone else.

12:29.225 --> 12:31.625
Everyone can see how hard you've worked,
what you've achieved,

12:31.705 --> 12:32.785
and what you're capable of.

12:33.425 --> 12:34.745
If you know you've done well,

12:35.585 --> 12:37.105
don't let other people's
opinions get to you.

12:39.425 --> 12:40.505
Then tell me.

12:44.145 --> 12:46.225
Would you have scored me fairly?

12:48.825 --> 12:49.865
What do you mean?

12:49.945 --> 12:51.225
Could you, Luan Nian,

12:53.185 --> 12:58.145
ignore that 250 million
and judge me fairly and objectively?

12:58.225 --> 12:59.425
Could you?

13:10.705 --> 13:13.585
Shang Zhitao,
this was another competition.

13:14.505 --> 13:16.385
Is it really that hard
to focus on doing your best?

13:17.185 --> 13:18.585
One result doesn't define you.

13:19.185 --> 13:22.705
As long as you keep doing well,
next time will be yours.

13:27.825 --> 13:28.985
This is the workplace, I know.

13:30.385 --> 13:32.505
Things are never completely fair.

13:32.585 --> 13:35.065
Relationships, connections, money.

13:35.145 --> 13:36.585
They can all come before ability.

13:36.665 --> 13:38.105
But I always thought this was different.

13:38.185 --> 13:40.265
Because it was Lime.

13:40.345 --> 13:43.665
It's the Lime that made an exception
to hire me and helped me grow so quickly.

13:43.745 --> 13:45.505
It was fair and objective.

13:45.585 --> 13:47.745
Anything was possible here.

13:48.705 --> 13:51.105
That's why I never thought I'd lose.

13:51.905 --> 13:53.545
And I don't want to be
the last one to know

13:53.625 --> 13:55.385
that the outcome was already decided.

13:56.585 --> 13:58.825
Shang Zhitao, I never thought you were
someone who couldn't handle losing.

14:00.265 --> 14:01.945
There are winners and losers
in the workplace.

14:02.025 --> 14:04.145
Adults should know
how to accept the result.

14:05.345 --> 14:08.065
You're only this upset because
you think I didn't treat you differently.

14:08.145 --> 14:09.145
Am I right?

14:09.945 --> 14:11.145
Let me tell you this.

14:11.225 --> 14:13.385
I keep work and personal life
completely separate.

14:13.465 --> 14:14.985
I suggest you do the same.

14:15.785 --> 14:16.945
Otherwise, you're only making things
harder for yourself.

14:18.625 --> 14:19.825
I'm not like you.

14:22.225 --> 14:25.625
You can afford to lose with grace.

14:25.705 --> 14:27.185
I can't.

14:27.265 --> 14:31.385
From the first day I joined Lime,
all I've wanted was to survive here.

14:32.385 --> 14:35.105
Every single step I've taken
is like walking on thin ice.

14:35.185 --> 14:36.345
Do you understand?

14:43.305 --> 14:44.705
Luan Nian,

14:46.265 --> 14:47.425
of course you don't understand.

14:48.065 --> 14:49.945
If you did,
you wouldn't have asked me that.

14:50.025 --> 14:52.105
You wouldn't be talking to me like this.

14:53.905 --> 14:55.545
You've always looked down on me.

14:55.625 --> 14:56.665
You never believed I was good enough.

14:56.745 --> 14:57.905
You never thought I had what it takes.

14:57.985 --> 15:01.265
You've never respected me
or treated me as your equal.

15:01.345 --> 15:04.385
Why did I spend six years
with someone like you?

15:10.345 --> 15:11.585
What kind of person do you think I am?

15:16.865 --> 15:20.785
Arrogant. Conceited. Selfish.

15:24.305 --> 15:25.825
Is that really how you see me?

15:27.705 --> 15:29.585
Why do you always question me?

15:29.665 --> 15:31.425
Why am I always the one being doubted?

15:31.505 --> 15:34.465
Why are you always so condescending?

15:34.545 --> 15:35.945
Luan Nian.

15:37.545 --> 15:40.585
Is it really that hard
to talk to me properly?

15:44.985 --> 15:46.745
Shang Zhitao, you should calm down now.

15:49.105 --> 15:50.745
Why should I?

15:50.825 --> 15:52.465
Why do I have to calm down?

15:52.545 --> 15:55.305
I've struggled in this city for six years,

15:55.385 --> 15:57.105
and in the end, I've got nothing.

15:57.185 --> 15:58.825
I lost my best friend.

15:58.905 --> 16:01.425
I lost the competition I should've won.

16:01.505 --> 16:03.105
And now you're telling me to calm down.

16:03.185 --> 16:04.425
What gives you the right?

16:07.785 --> 16:09.505
My patience is wearing thin.

16:10.385 --> 16:11.745
Stop pushing me.

16:56.745 --> 16:58.985
I want to end this.

17:24.585 --> 17:25.625
End what?

17:27.545 --> 17:28.785
What are you ending?

17:38.785 --> 17:40.625
I'm ending…

17:44.665 --> 17:45.665
this filthy,

17:47.185 --> 17:48.265
ugly,

17:50.745 --> 17:52.385
disgusting relationship between us.

17:59.265 --> 18:01.665
You think our relationship was filthy?

18:02.185 --> 18:05.465
Ugly? Disgusting?

18:07.905 --> 18:10.545
It was never a normal relationship.

18:11.625 --> 18:13.865
We never trusted each other.

18:16.625 --> 18:18.665
We never loved each other.

18:25.545 --> 18:28.505
So you were only with me
to get ahead in your career?

18:29.385 --> 18:33.265
And now that you lost,
you think I've outlived my usefulness?

18:34.425 --> 18:36.425
The main reason I lost

18:36.505 --> 18:40.065
was spending six years
with someone like you.

18:40.145 --> 18:43.505
Someone who couldn't judge me fairly.

18:43.585 --> 18:44.425
Exactly.

18:46.265 --> 18:47.585
You said it yourself.

18:47.665 --> 18:49.025
We were only together for six years.

18:49.545 --> 18:50.985
There weren't any real feelings.

18:51.745 --> 18:55.545
If it wasn't you,
it could've been someone else.

19:26.905 --> 19:28.025
Let's end it here.

20:04.745 --> 20:07.825
I can't accept adding Yilia
to this year's Specialist selection.

20:08.825 --> 20:10.545
She hasn't been here long enough.

20:10.625 --> 20:12.185
She doesn't meet
the company's requirements.

20:12.265 --> 20:14.305
You know this.

20:14.385 --> 20:16.905
It was a special exception by the board.

20:17.585 --> 20:18.625
I don't agree.

20:18.705 --> 20:21.385
Luke, it's only an extra candidate.

20:25.265 --> 20:26.825
You and I both know

20:27.425 --> 20:30.225
Flora deserves
this year's Specialist title.

20:30.985 --> 20:32.945
She spent over a year
working in the Northwest for this project.

20:34.665 --> 20:40.065
And you also know Yilia brought Lime
250 million in ad spending.

20:40.145 --> 20:41.625
That's enough to change the rules.

20:41.705 --> 20:44.785
I admit Yilia is capable.
She's delivered results.

20:44.865 --> 20:45.825
You can promote her,

20:45.905 --> 20:48.425
give her a raise,
or a huge bonus if you want,

20:48.505 --> 20:51.265
but the Specialist title recognizes
ability, seniority, and experience.

20:51.345 --> 20:53.745
I won't accept the company
changing the rules on a whim.

21:02.265 --> 21:03.265
What are you going to do?

21:03.905 --> 21:06.265
I pulled some records as requested.

21:06.985 --> 21:09.985
The first person Flora informed
about weekend overtime was you.

21:10.505 --> 21:12.985
The first person
she traveled with was you.

21:13.065 --> 21:15.185
The security footage was reviewed too.

21:15.265 --> 21:18.345
Every Friday night, you two always left
the office one after the other.

21:18.425 --> 21:22.465
You know those facts can't be changed.

21:24.825 --> 21:25.665
Fine.

21:26.265 --> 21:28.185
I'll leave. I'll resign.

21:28.265 --> 21:30.185
But you know perfectly well,

21:30.265 --> 21:32.145
if you leave,
she won't be able to stay either.

21:41.545 --> 21:43.105
I'm due to report to the US.

21:43.745 --> 21:45.665
There's an opening
for President over there.

21:45.745 --> 21:46.705
I turned it down before.

21:48.185 --> 21:51.225
Now I can apply for the transfer.

21:51.305 --> 21:52.785
On one condition.

21:52.865 --> 21:54.825
Flora stays at Lime.

22:00.185 --> 22:02.265
This job means everything to her.

22:03.705 --> 22:05.425
I know.

22:06.305 --> 22:09.945
I've watched her fight
her way up over the past six years.

22:10.025 --> 22:11.505
I want her to stay too.

22:13.185 --> 22:18.385
But this year's Specialist title
must go to Yilia.

22:20.105 --> 22:21.225
Give it to Yilia then.

22:21.745 --> 22:25.665
Next year, create
another Specialist position for Flora.

22:27.385 --> 22:30.025
Don't worry.
I'll do everything I can for her.

22:34.585 --> 22:37.825
Never thought you'd actually fall in love.

22:40.945 --> 22:42.305
I have one more request.

22:42.945 --> 22:44.385
Keep all this from Flora.

22:45.985 --> 22:46.985
Why?

22:47.665 --> 22:50.025
Wouldn't it be better
if she knew what you've done for her?

22:52.745 --> 22:54.105
She's too proud.

22:54.785 --> 22:59.385
If she finds out,
she'll either leave Lime or leave me.

23:01.665 --> 23:04.065
Alright. You have my word.

23:08.985 --> 23:09.825
Thank you.

23:14.305 --> 23:15.825
I'm ending

23:17.625 --> 23:21.465
this filthy, ugly,
disgusting relationship between us.

23:37.865 --> 23:40.345
You're only this upset because
you think I didn't treat you specially.

23:40.425 --> 23:41.305
Am I right?

23:41.385 --> 23:44.025
I keep work and personal life
completely separate.

23:44.105 --> 23:45.665
I suggest you do the same.

23:46.345 --> 23:47.785
Otherwise, you're only
making things harder for yourself.

23:48.625 --> 23:50.345
We were only together for six years.

23:50.425 --> 23:52.185
If it wasn't you,

23:52.985 --> 23:54.105
it could've been someone else.

24:34.145 --> 24:34.985
Shang Zhitao,

24:36.305 --> 24:37.545
don't be impulsive.

24:38.505 --> 24:40.745
I'm not. I'm taking Luke with me.

24:43.505 --> 24:44.865
You're an adult.

24:48.305 --> 24:49.385
If you say it's over,

24:50.425 --> 24:51.705
then don't ever start it again.

25:01.985 --> 25:03.225
I never will.

25:13.785 --> 25:15.345
Let's go, Luke.

25:16.665 --> 25:17.585
Come on, Luke.

25:25.985 --> 25:27.105
Luke.

25:37.985 --> 25:39.505
Listen.

25:39.585 --> 25:41.545
You can only choose one.

25:41.625 --> 25:42.905
If you stay,

25:42.985 --> 25:44.705
you'll never see me again.

25:45.505 --> 25:46.385
Luke.

25:50.425 --> 25:51.305
We're leaving.

25:57.585 --> 25:58.465
Let's go, Luke.

25:59.145 --> 26:01.345
Come on. Let's go, Luke.

26:11.145 --> 26:12.385
You're staying, aren't you?

26:16.065 --> 26:16.905
Fine.

26:21.985 --> 26:24.145
You stay. I'll go.

27:31.945 --> 27:34.545
You ungrateful Luke,
you chose the rich over the poor.

27:34.625 --> 27:36.105
Even you betrayed me.

28:08.385 --> 28:10.065
Luke.

28:13.865 --> 28:15.865
Thank you, Luke.

29:16.305 --> 29:18.185
We'll start a new life together.

30:06.465 --> 30:07.385
Here's some warm water.

30:16.465 --> 30:17.305
Sun Yu.

30:23.585 --> 30:25.465
I didn't get promoted.

30:27.945 --> 30:29.425
I prepared for so long.

30:30.585 --> 30:32.225
I really thought I'd win.

30:34.985 --> 30:36.145
But I lost.

30:37.465 --> 30:38.505
I…

30:43.145 --> 30:43.985
I…

30:50.785 --> 30:52.745
I let Zhu down

30:54.305 --> 30:57.625
after everything he did for me.

31:06.825 --> 31:10.585
Tao, don't scare me.

31:10.665 --> 31:12.705
Promise me you won't do anything silly.

31:14.105 --> 31:15.585
You know that.

31:17.585 --> 31:19.385
I can't lose another friend. You hear me?

31:22.585 --> 31:24.465
Don't cry. I can't handle it when you cry.

31:24.545 --> 31:25.745
Please don't cry.

31:33.145 --> 31:34.625
Please don't cry.

31:42.305 --> 31:43.425
Take this.

31:55.305 --> 31:57.065
My company's doing great now.

31:57.825 --> 32:00.745
I'd sincerely like to invite you
to be our Vice President.

32:00.825 --> 32:03.705
Once we secure Series C funding,
we'll expand into the south.

32:04.345 --> 32:08.425
With your ability, you could be
an executive at any company.

32:09.425 --> 32:10.665
Can I still steal you away?

32:13.105 --> 32:17.665
I'll have HR talk to you
about the salary, alright?

32:19.065 --> 32:19.905
No more crying.

32:23.385 --> 32:24.345
Don't worry.

32:25.425 --> 32:26.425
I'm okay.

32:27.105 --> 32:28.105
I just

32:29.985 --> 32:31.305
broke up.

32:33.505 --> 32:35.665
I haven't gotten over it yet. I…

32:39.825 --> 32:40.705
It…

32:43.025 --> 32:43.985
It hurts.

33:48.465 --> 33:49.305
MOM

33:49.385 --> 33:51.825
Tao, when are you taking leave?

33:51.905 --> 33:53.785
Your dad told me not to tell you,

33:53.865 --> 33:55.385
but he fell downstairs a few days ago.

33:55.465 --> 33:56.745
He broke a bone.

33:56.825 --> 33:58.945
He keeps saying he wants to see you.

33:59.025 --> 34:01.825
Can you take a few days off

34:01.905 --> 34:03.945
and come home early?

34:04.025 --> 34:05.185
If you're too busy, then forget it.

34:27.744 --> 34:29.185
Got it, Luke.

34:58.345 --> 35:00.985
-Where are you going?
-To hand in my resignation.

35:28.465 --> 35:29.305
Luke.

35:34.065 --> 35:35.905
That's fast.

35:35.985 --> 35:37.425
Are you leaving for the US next week?

35:37.505 --> 35:39.785
The position has been vacant.

35:39.865 --> 35:41.825
They want me there early to take over.

35:42.425 --> 35:43.585
See you.

36:40.065 --> 36:42.225
RESIGNATION FORM, SHANG ZHITAO

36:46.905 --> 36:51.185
Flora, there'll be another
Specialist selection next year.

36:53.585 --> 36:55.905
I'll do my best to help you get it.

36:59.345 --> 37:00.825
Thank you, Tracy,

37:00.905 --> 37:03.145
but I'm not leaving because of that.

37:05.825 --> 37:06.985
You don't need to thank me.

37:07.545 --> 37:08.905
If anyone deserves thanks,

37:08.985 --> 37:10.505
it's you,

37:10.585 --> 37:14.265
for all your hard work
and perseverance over the years.

37:17.385 --> 37:18.545
I still want to thank you.

37:19.585 --> 37:22.985
Thank you for helping me
and encouraging me.

37:26.345 --> 37:28.625
I've already bought my ticket home.

37:29.305 --> 37:30.705
Please sign it for me.

37:32.905 --> 37:33.865
Flora.

37:34.945 --> 37:38.905
I hired you myself.

37:38.985 --> 37:43.825
I've watched you work hard
and earn everything you have today.

37:44.425 --> 37:45.625
I'm proud of you.

37:45.705 --> 37:47.905
So hearing you resign,

37:47.985 --> 37:50.825
I really hate to see you go.

37:52.185 --> 37:53.985
I hope you'll think it over.

37:55.225 --> 37:57.265
Not just for yourself,
but also for your career,

37:59.665 --> 38:00.905
and Luke too.

38:08.265 --> 38:13.545
I… I heard from Lumi
that Luke's going to the US.

38:14.985 --> 38:18.865
At my level, I don't think my resignation
needs his approval.

38:20.785 --> 38:21.785
Tracy.

38:23.665 --> 38:25.385
Just help me one last time.

38:26.625 --> 38:27.905
Please sign it.

38:28.745 --> 38:30.465
Something happened at home.

38:30.545 --> 38:31.945
I have to go back.

38:40.905 --> 38:42.145
Alright.

39:01.665 --> 39:02.625
Thank you, Tracy.

39:18.425 --> 39:20.905
Your first rotation
is with Business Division One.

39:22.825 --> 39:23.745
You can sit here.

39:24.425 --> 39:26.905
Lumi, I'm Shang Zhitao.

39:26.985 --> 39:28.065
My English name is Flora.

39:29.225 --> 39:30.185
Since Lime hired me,

39:30.265 --> 39:33.265
I believe I have something of value.

39:33.345 --> 39:36.505
Being able to join the world's top
advertising agency and broaden my horizons

39:36.585 --> 39:38.665
is both an honor and a stroke of luck.

39:38.745 --> 39:40.585
I'll work hard and earn my place here.

40:51.305 --> 40:53.545
Goodbye, Lime.

41:09.705 --> 41:10.945
Have some water.

41:11.025 --> 41:12.105
Thanks.

41:14.785 --> 41:17.785
Do either of you
have Zhu's family's contact?

41:19.545 --> 41:20.425
Why?

41:21.305 --> 41:22.905
I still owe him money.

41:25.545 --> 41:27.265
I might as well tell you now.

41:27.945 --> 41:30.065
The money my ex-wife and I used
to buy the apartment

41:30.745 --> 41:32.065
was borrowed from Zhu.

41:33.465 --> 41:35.225
He told me not to tell you.

41:35.305 --> 41:37.025
He said he wanted to give you two a home.

41:39.985 --> 41:43.225
But before you could enjoy it for long,
the family fell apart.

41:51.305 --> 41:52.505
One of you is heading south,

41:52.585 --> 41:54.185
and the other is going back home.

41:54.265 --> 41:55.905
So I thought

41:56.425 --> 41:58.865
while the housing market was still good,
I'd sell the apartment.

41:59.665 --> 42:03.385
He's gone now,
but I still owe it to his family.

42:04.185 --> 42:05.985
If you sell the apartment,
where will you live?

42:06.785 --> 42:08.505
Me? I got promoted.

42:08.585 --> 42:11.505
The company's giving me a dorm,
so I'll save on rent.

42:13.305 --> 42:14.345
From now on,

42:14.425 --> 42:17.305
call me Deputy Product Manager
of the Marketing Department.

42:20.185 --> 42:21.465
You got promoted.
Dinner's on you then, Lei?

42:22.065 --> 42:22.945
Of course.

42:23.025 --> 42:24.985
Let's go somewhere expensive then.
Same as always.

42:25.705 --> 42:26.825
Works for me.

42:27.785 --> 42:30.785
When I get back home,
I'm changing my phone number.

42:32.185 --> 42:37.985
The day I call you again
will be the day I have truly started over.

42:42.185 --> 42:43.825
We'll all be doing better.

42:49.985 --> 42:51.225
Before you go,

42:52.065 --> 42:52.945
let's take one last photo.

42:53.465 --> 42:54.825
Sure. Let's take one.

42:56.545 --> 42:57.505
Let's…

42:57.585 --> 42:59.345
-Let's take one with this.
-Okay.

43:11.585 --> 43:12.665
I'll go get the car.

43:17.545 --> 43:19.465
-Thank you, Lei.
-Don't mention it.

43:20.865 --> 43:22.105
Open the trunk.

43:34.825 --> 43:38.265
Tonight, I'm cooking for you guys.

43:38.345 --> 43:40.625
I just learned a new dish.
Lightning Five Whips!

43:40.705 --> 43:42.225
-How is that?
-That's the name of a dish?

43:45.545 --> 43:47.865
Tao. Tao.

43:49.145 --> 43:50.065
We're leaving. Get in.

43:50.785 --> 43:51.625
Here.

43:53.825 --> 43:54.665
Hop in.

43:55.385 --> 43:58.385
TIANTONG DONGYUAN

43:58.465 --> 44:00.625
TIANTONGYUAN GYMNASIUM

44:00.705 --> 44:01.985
TIANTONG RENHE TCM HOSPITAL

44:06.385 --> 44:07.465
Tao,

44:08.625 --> 44:10.225
take good care of yourself
when you get home.

44:12.305 --> 44:13.865
Call me, okay?

44:15.105 --> 44:17.385
Yeah. Take care, Tao.

44:17.465 --> 44:18.625
If anyone gives you a hard time,

44:18.705 --> 44:19.865
call me right away.

44:19.945 --> 44:21.545
I'll fly over and beat them up.

44:24.145 --> 44:24.985
Alright.

44:26.145 --> 44:27.745
I have your word on that.

44:27.825 --> 44:28.665
You do.

45:05.665 --> 45:06.905
LUMI

45:06.985 --> 45:09.465
I'm going to miss you, Lumi.

45:16.385 --> 45:18.785
SHANG ZHITAO: I'M GOING TO MISS YOU, LUMI

45:21.785 --> 45:23.465
I hate goodbye.

45:24.065 --> 45:27.385
Shang Zhitao, you heartless little thing.

45:39.945 --> 45:43.505
Shang Zhitao, you'd better live well.

45:50.545 --> 45:53.105
Could I have another osmanthus milk?

46:03.825 --> 46:08.065
LUAN NIAN

46:18.905 --> 46:22.585
LUAN NIAN

46:24.585 --> 46:26.745
Thank you for these past six years.

46:28.665 --> 46:30.025
All the best.

46:38.785 --> 46:41.945
LUAN NIAN

46:42.025 --> 46:44.425
BLOCK THIS CALLER

46:56.505 --> 46:57.945
This isn't running away.

47:01.025 --> 47:04.265
It is a grand retreat.

47:05.865 --> 47:07.985
Because I want to give myself
another possibility.

47:13.585 --> 47:15.345
BEIJING TO HARBIN

47:17.425 --> 47:18.345
Goodbye,

47:19.625 --> 47:20.465
Beijing.

47:47.985 --> 47:49.465
Shang Zhitao.

47:50.705 --> 47:53.465
Are these all limited editions?

47:54.425 --> 47:56.065
Not bad.

47:56.145 --> 47:58.065
Lime has treated you well
these past years.

48:00.825 --> 48:04.665
The company has that year-end flea market.

48:04.745 --> 48:06.945
I'm leaving, so I won't make it.

48:07.025 --> 48:08.705
Help me sell these.

48:08.785 --> 48:10.185
Half price to our colleagues.

48:11.105 --> 48:12.945
Then we'll split the money.

48:13.025 --> 48:14.265
Just get rid of them quickly.

48:15.145 --> 48:16.505
You didn't buy these yourself, did you?

48:18.225 --> 48:21.105
They were gifts from my boyfriend.

48:21.185 --> 48:22.505
Luke bought them for you?

48:24.705 --> 48:27.425
You didn't really think I couldn't tell,
did you?

48:27.505 --> 48:29.985
You're leaving now.
I don't have to pretend anymore.

48:34.585 --> 48:36.265
It's all over.

48:37.985 --> 48:39.345
I'm leaving

48:41.625 --> 48:43.025
Beijing.

48:46.105 --> 48:47.145
Why?

48:49.905 --> 48:51.665
My dad hurt his leg.

48:53.025 --> 48:54.065
People always say,

48:54.145 --> 48:56.145
"When your parents are alive,
don't live too far away."

48:57.025 --> 48:59.065
I've been chasing this dream for years.

49:00.745 --> 49:03.265
I'm tired. I want to go home.

49:03.865 --> 49:06.745
I've already arranged for Luke
to be taken to Harbin.

49:06.825 --> 49:10.065
From now on,
he's officially a Northeastern pup.

49:12.505 --> 49:16.145
You're really giving up
everything you've built in Beijing?

49:17.225 --> 49:18.745
Do you have no regrets?

49:31.985 --> 49:35.585
Thinking about it now, career growth,

49:36.505 --> 49:39.705
double the salary,
none of it really matters.

49:42.065 --> 49:44.065
I don't need to prove myself
anymore to anyone.

49:44.825 --> 49:48.825
I think being with my parents
is what really matters.

49:52.785 --> 49:54.585
You've had an epiphany.

50:00.505 --> 50:01.865
Screw this job.

50:02.465 --> 50:04.785
I wish you all the best. Shang Zhitao.

50:07.145 --> 50:09.385
If you ever need anything,
you can always come to me.

50:09.465 --> 50:10.705
Okay?

50:11.865 --> 50:13.345
If anyone bullies you, I'll beat them up.

50:17.945 --> 50:19.905
Enough with the sad stuff.
What should we eat today?

50:21.225 --> 50:23.265
My treat. Deal?

50:23.345 --> 50:25.145
We'll meet again. I promise.
